native editable shapes, tables, and charts where possible.\n37: - Set a slide layout before placing content and keep all coordinates within the\n38:   canvas.\n39: - Use Graphviz only when a diagram is truly needed; render it to a high-quality\n40:   image before inserting it.\n41: - If React/Sharp are used for icons, rasterize the SVG at a sufficiently high\n42:   resolution before embedding it.\n43: - Keep temporary previews and scripts outside the requested output directory.\n\n(End of file - total 43 lines)\n</content>","type":"function_call_output","id":null,"status":null},{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /workspace/input && for f in 1 2 3 4; do echo \\\"=== $f.pptx ===\\\"; markitdown $f.pptx | head -60; done\", \"description\": \"Extract text from the four PPTX files\"}","call_id":"bash_0_d93ba6de","name":"bash","type":"function_call","id":null,"status":null,"namespace":null},{"call_id":"bash_0_d93ba6de","output":"=== 1.pptx ===\n<!-- Slide number: 1 -->\n\n![图片包含 事情, 玩具 已生成极高可信度的说明](图片2.jpg)\n\n![](WilliamJosephRadioactive.jpg)\n\n![](Picture2.jpg)\n\n### Notes:\n\n<!-- Slide number: 2 -->\n\n![](图片3.jpg)\n\n![](图片4.jpg)\n01\nSet 1\n02\nSet 2\n03\nSet 3\n04\nSet 4\n05\nSet 5\n06\nSet 6\n\n### Notes:\n\n<!-- Slide number: 3 -->\n\n![](图片4.jpg)\n\n![](Picture2.jpg)\n\n### Notes:\n\n<!-- Slide number: 4 -->\n\n![图片包含 事情, 物体 已生成高可信度的说明](图片29.jpg)\n\n![图片包含 事情, 物体 已生成高可信度的说明](图片28.jpg)\nRooster\n\n![](图片1.jpg)\n\n### Notes:\n\n<!-- Slide number: 5 -->\n\n![图片包含 事情, 物体 已生成高可信度的说明](图片29.jpg)\n\n![图片包含 事情, 物体 已生成高可信度的说明](图片28.jpg)\nFootball\n\n![](图片2.jpg)\n\n### Notes:\n\n=== 2.pptx ===\n<!-- Slide number: 1 -->\n\n![](WilliamJosephRadioactive.jpg)\n# Charades (Animals)\n\n![C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\MEDIA\\CAGCAT10\\j0332364.wmf](Picture2.jpg)\n\n### Notes:\n\n<!-- Slide number: 2 -->\n# Game Rules\nForm teams freely, with two people per group: one acts and one guesses. The group with the most correct answers within one minute wins.\nThe guesser must face away from the screen and may not peek, otherwise the turn is forfeited.\nThe actor may use speech and body language as hints, but may not say or write any word related to the answer.\nThe actor may decide whether to skip to the next question.\n\n<!-- Slide number: 3 -->\n# Alpaca\n\n![1334209829486.jpg](图片4.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 4 -->\n# Hedgehog\n\n![201509-120G921431437.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 5 -->\n# Cricket\n\n![2493573_101435021_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 6 -->\n# Seagull\n\n![01300000174719121461624409537.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 7 -->\n# Squirrel\n\n![11305181_202142399166_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 8 -->\n# Cobra\n\n![20087216544560_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 9 -->\n\n![3329809_185235003082_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n# Bat\n\n<!-- Slide number: 10 -->\n\n![2008121015265698_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n# Owl\n\n<!-- Slide number: 11 -->\n\n![2531170_100210443936_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n# Pigeon\n=== 3.pptx ===\n<!-- Slide number: 1 -->\n\n![](WilliamJosephRadioactive.jpg)\nLet's test how in sync we are!\n\nCharades\n\n<!-- Slide number: 2 -->\nGame Rules:\n    1. Four audience members volunteer to come on stage. The game is played in two rounds, with two people per team in each round: one acts and one guesses.\n    2. Time limit: 2 minutes.\n    3. During guessing, the actor may not say any character contained in the answer, nor describe its pronunciation, writing, or English meaning; otherwise the answer is invalid.\n    4. The guesser may not look at the screen, otherwise the answer is invalid.\n    5. Audience members off the stage may not give hints.\n    6. If a clue cannot be guessed, the team may shout \"Pass,\" but only 3 times per round.\n    7. The final winner is determined by the number of correct answers.\n\n<!-- Slide number: 3 -->\nGet Ready\n   Start the Timer!\n\n<!-- Slide number: 4 -->\nQuestion 1:\nSwimming\n\n<!-- Slide number: 5 -->\nQuestion 2:\nRoly-Poly Toy\n\n<!-- Slide number: 6 -->\nQuestion 3:\nCannot Wait\n\n<!-- Slide number: 7 -->\nQuestion 4:\nThe Blazing Sun Scorches Like Fire\n\n<!-- Slide number: 8 -->\nQuestion 5:\nOpen and Upright\n\n<!-- Slide number: 9 -->\nQuestion 6:\nAbundant Talents\n\n<!-- Slide number: 10 -->\nQuestion 7:\nEver-changing\n\n<!-- Slide number: 11 -->\nQuestion 8:\nRunning\n\n<!-- Slide number: 12 -->\nQuestion 9:\nWalking the Dog\n\n<!-- Slide number: 13 -->\nQuestion 10:\nTreat Everyone Equally\n=== 4.pptx ===\n<!-- Slide number: 1 -->\n\n![](WilliamJosephRadioactive.jpg)\n# Charades (Idioms)\n\n![C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\MEDIA\\CAGCAT10\\j0297707.wmf](Picture3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 2 -->\n# Game Rules\nForm teams freely, with two people per group: one acts and one guesses. The group with the most correct answers within one minute wins.\nThe guesser must face away from the screen and may not peek, otherwise the turn is forfeited.\nThe actor may use speech and body language as hints, but may not say or write any word related to the answer.\nThe actor may decide whether to skip to the next question.\n\n<!-- Slide number: 3 -->\n# A Dragonfly Skimming the Water\n\n![8185804_125327929000_2.jpg](内容占位符7.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 4 -->\n# Draw Legs on a Snake\n\n![P12C4Y55440E25AR.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 5 -->\n# A Bird Startled by the Mere Twang of a Bow\n\n![1.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 6 -->\n# Wait by a Tree Stump for a Rabbit\n\n![3.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 7 -->\n# Stand Head and Shoulders Above the Crowd\n\n![2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 8 -->\n# A Cornered Dog Will Jump Over the Wall\n\n![4.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 9 -->\n# Wolf Down Food\n\n![1.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 10 -->\nDragons Soar and Phoenixes Dance\n\n<!-- Slide number: 11 -->\n# Wear a Long Face\n\n![5.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n\n<!-- Slide number: 12 -->\n# Blind Men Feeling an Elephant\n\n","type":"function_call_output","id":null,"st