.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1117: \n1118: <!-- Slide number: 9 -->\n1119: \n1120: ![3329809_185235003082_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1121: # Bat\n1122: \n1123: <!-- Slide number: 10 -->\n1124: \n1125: ![2008121015265698_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1126: # Owl\n1127: \n1128: <!-- Slide number: 11 -->\n1129: \n1130: ![2531170_100210443936_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1131: # Pigeon\n1132: \n1133: ![](图片4.jpg)\n1134: \n1135: <!-- Slide number: 12 -->\n1136: # Zebra\n1137: \n1138: ![4485939_094647025635_2.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1139: \n1140: <!-- Slide number: 13 -->\n1141: # Golden Snub-nosed Monkey\n1142: \n1143: ![u=3134937976,2293862669&fm=21&gp=0.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1144: \n1145: <!-- Slide number: 14 -->\n1146: \n1147: ![300001021561128825086798053_950.jpg](内容占位符3.jpg)\n1148: # Cheetah\n1149: === 3.pptx ===\n1150: <!-- Slide number: 1 -->\n1151: \n1152: ![](WilliamJosephRadioactive.jpg)\n1153: Let's test how in sync we are!\n1154: \n1155: Charades\n1156: \n1157: <!-- Slide number: 2 -->\n1158: Game Rules:\n1159:     1. Four audience members volunteer to come on stage. The game is played in two rounds, with two people per team in each round: one acts and one guesses.\n1160:     2. Time limit: 2 minutes.\n1161:     3. During guessing, the actor may not say any character contained in the answer, nor describe its pronunciation, writing, or English meaning; otherwise the answer is invalid.\n1162:     4. The guesser may not look at the screen, otherwise the answer is invalid.\n1163:     5. Audience members off the stage may not give hints.\n1164:     6. If a clue cannot be guessed, the team may shout \"Pass,\" but only 3 times per round.\n1165:     7. The final winner is determined by the number of correct answers.\n1166: \n1167: <!-- Slide number: 3 -->\n1168: Get Ready\n1169:    Start the Timer!\n1170: \n1171: <!-- Slide number: 4 -->\n1172: Question 1:\n1173: Swimming\n1174: \n1175: <!-- Slide number: 5 -->\n1176: Question 2:\n1177: Roly-Poly Toy\n1178: \n1179: <!-- Slide number: 6 -->\n1180: Question 3:\n1